            "name": "Etsy Get Payments",
            "description": {
              "content": "<div class=\"wt-display-flex-xs wt-align-items-center wt-mt-xs-2 wt-mb-xs-3\"><span class=\"wt-badge wt-badge--notificationPrimary wt-bg-slime-tint wt-mr-xs-2\">General Release</span><a class=\"wt-text-link\" href=\"https://github.com/etsy/open-api/discussions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Report bug</a></div><div class=\"wt-display-flex-xs wt-align-items-center wt-mt-xs-2 wt-mb-xs-3\"><p class=\"wt-text-body-01 banner-text\">This endpoint is ready for production use.</p></div>\n\nRetrieves a list of payments from a shop identified by `shop_id`. You can also filter results using a list of payment IDs.",
